"Hi {customer_first_name},\n"
"\n"
"We have an update on your order #{order_number}. The estimated delivery date has changed from {old_eta} to {new_eta}.\n"
"\n"
"Sea freight and customs timings can shift a little, and we will keep you posted if anything changes again."
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-eta-updated.php:39
